- Initial package, version 0.9.5
  * Builds the vendored libghostty-vt with zig 0.16 from an
    offline package cache (zig-deps.tar.zst, vendor-zig.sh)
  * Run only the configuration unit tests in %check: most of the
    suite needs git, agent CLIs, network access or a real terminal
  * Add 0001-disable-background-update-checks-by-default.patch:
    do not contact herdr.dev for new releases or agent-detection
    manifests unless [update] version_check / manifest_check is
    enabled in the configuration

